Weapon scripts outside the milestone set (TestData/weapons holds exactly the
milestone's 32, which the weapon-table facts enumerate): read only by the facts
that name them, through WeaponFixtures.WithExtras.

tf_weapon_handgun_scout_secondary: the scout's back_headshot pistol class, for
TFDamageLayerTests' hit-location fact (CTFPistol_ScoutSecondary::GetDamageType).
Extracted and trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README describes.
